      "sourceTextSha256": "68ffc4ddf3685f8553296fd2c3b2afb97083c5cabe799f8194634c7e0b9711d0",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-worker-mw96kqoe-lg4q4klwz6",
        "model": "GPT-6"
      },
      "text": "After breakfast, take a scheduled bus to Acapulco.\n\nAcapulco lies on the Pacific coast and is known for its beaches, bay and resort facilities.\n\nSpend two nights in a standard room at the 4-star Emporio.\n\nThe rest of the day is free after the transfer. After several days of museums, archaeological sites and colonial towns, the focus in Acapulco shifts to the coast and time to relax. A half-day tour is planned for the following day, so you can settle in after the bus ride and spend the evening at your leisure."
    },
